# Summary

The charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter [[cite:obs-06d874488b488549087fa90bc024d8db5e5c8229 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]. According to the annex, the ordinary contributions amount to one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January [[cite:obs-fb5f68efe21ead17278108d2f474e15fb652ef36 "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]].